# Lean proof artifacts under formal/ are source, not build output. These
# negations guard against user-global ignore patterns (e.g. Hardhat's
# unanchored "artifacts") silently hiding new generated proof payloads.
!**/Artifacts/
!**/Artifacts/**

# Contract checks import local Python modules. Their bytecode is not source.
protocol-contract/__pycache__/
